{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20103","headline":"春日同韦郎中使君送邹儒立少府扶侍赴云阳 · 孟郊","name":"春日同韦郎中使君送邹儒立少府扶侍赴云阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离思着百草，绵绵生无穷。\n侧闻畿甸秀，三振词策雄。\n太守不韵俗，诸生皆变风。\n郡斋敞西清，楚瑟惊南鸿。\n海畔帝城望，云阳天色中。\n酒酣正芳景，诗缀新碧丛。\n服彩老莱并，侍车江革同。\n过隋柳顦顇，入洛花蒙笼。\n高步讵留足，前程在层空。\n独慙病鹤羽，飞送力难崇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20103.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20103","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}